Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:59.03,0:11:01.12,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}私 なぜ また生きてるの？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.41,0:11:03.24,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为了什么
