Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:04.74,0:11:05.60,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为了谁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:04.74,0:11:05.60,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}誰のために？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:06.83,0:11:07.87,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}第五适格者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:06.83,0:11:07.87,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}フィフスチルドレン
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:08.34,0:11:10.90,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那个人，我觉得他跟我一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:08.34,0:11:10.90,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あのヒト 私と同じ感じがする
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.62,0:11:13.17,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.62,0:11:13.17,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}どうして？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:19.31,0:11:21.21,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还好这里是郊外
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:19.31,0:11:21.21,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ここが街外れでよかったわ
