Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:21.72,0:11:23.82,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あなたが巻き込まれなくて よかったもの
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:24.86,0:11:26.90,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是，下次没办法保证
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:24.86,0:11:26.90,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}でも この次の保証はないの
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.70,0:11:30.75,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以明天起由洞木家照顾你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.70,0:11:30.75,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}だから あしたからは 洞木さんちのお世話になるのよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.24,0:11:33.38,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}暂时要分别了喔，翩翩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.24,0:11:33.38,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}しばらく お別れね ペンペン
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.48,0:11:43.29,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还是我睡地上好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.48,0:11:43.29,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}やはり 僕が下で寝るよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:43.97,0:11:46.80,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没关系啦，是我硬要住你这里的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:43.97,0:11:46.80,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}いいよ 僕が無理言って 泊めてもらってるんだ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:47.28,0:11:48.03,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以我睡这就好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:47.28,0:11:48.03,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ここでいいよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:52.41,0:11:54.09,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你是不是有话想告诉我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:52.41,0:11:54.09,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}君は何を話したいんだい？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:54.61,0:11:54.84,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}咦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:54.61,0:11:54.84,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}え？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:55.83,0:11:57.80,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你不是有话想说给我听吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:55.83,0:11:57.80,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}僕に聞いてほしいことが あるんだろ？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.82,0:12:02.14,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}其实我来到这后，发生了不少事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.82,0:12:02.14,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}いろいろあったんだ ここに来て
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:03.76,0:12:06.35,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}来这之前，我住在老师那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:03.76,0:12:06.35,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}来る前は 先生の所にいたんだ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:07.28,0:12:08.96,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那是一段安稳而乏善可陈的日子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:07.28,0:12:08.96,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}穏やかで なんにもない日々だった
