Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:22.78,0:12:24.74,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过，我讨厌爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:22.78,0:12:24.74,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ただ 父さんは嫌いだった
