Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.56,0:13:03.71,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}有个男人想在里面的希望出现之前把盒子关起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.56,0:13:03.71,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そこにある希望が現れる前に 箱を閉じようとしている男がいる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:04.98,0:13:05.77,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}希望
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:04.98,0:13:05.77,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}希望？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:06.47,0:13:08.40,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那就是 Lilin 的希望吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:06.47,0:13:08.40,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あれがリリンの希望ですか
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.82,0:13:11.80,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}有多少人就有多少种不同的希望
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.82,0:13:11.80,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}希望の形は人の数ほど存在する
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:12.25,0:13:15.70,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为希望只存在于人的心中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:12.25,0:13:15.70,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}希望は人の心の中にしか存在しないからだ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:16.28,0:13:19.32,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是我们的希望已经具体化
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:16.28,0:13:19.32,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}だが、我らの希望は具象化されている
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:19.91,0:13:24.54,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那就是伪造的继承者，来自黑之月的我们人类
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:19.91,0:13:24.54,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}それは偽りの継承者である 黒き月よりの我ら人類
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:24.70,0:13:26.51,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}其始祖即为莉莉丝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:24.70,0:13:26.51,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}その始祖たるリリス
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:26.95,0:13:31.49,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还有正统继承者，来自失落白之月的使徒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:26.95,0:13:31.49,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そして正統な継承者たる 失われた白き月よりの使徒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:31.75,0:13:33.45,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}其始祖即为亚当
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:31.75,0:13:33.45,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}その始祖たるアダム
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:34.00,0:13:37.56,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只有在你体内才有那个被拯救的灵魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:34.00,0:13:37.56,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そのサルベージされた魂は君の中にしかない
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:37.86,0:13:42.09,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是，再生的肉体已经在碇的身体内
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:37.86,0:13:42.09,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}だが 再生された肉体は既に碇の中にある
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.42,0:13:44.43,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣的父亲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.42,0:13:44.43,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}シンジ君の父親
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:44.90,0:13:46.22,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}他和我也一样的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:44.90,0:13:46.22,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}彼も僕と同じか
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:46.76,0:13:50.48,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}正因为如此才把我们的心愿寄托在你身上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:46.76,0:13:50.48,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}だからこそ、お前に託す 我らの願いを
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.61,0:13:53.87,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我明白了…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.61,0:13:53.87,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}分かっていますよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:54.08,0:13:57.13,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为此我现在才会在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:54.08,0:13:57.13,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そのために僕は今ここにいるわけですから
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:59.00,0:13:59.98,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:59.00,0:13:59.98,JPBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ダメだわ
